# File policy

## App boundaries

- API code only in `apps/backend`.
- UI only in `apps/frontend`.
- DB schema, migrations, and Prisma client config only in `apps/prisma`.
- Docker / Compose / Traefik only in `infra/`.
- Do not duplicate `schema.prisma`, Dockerfiles, or env templates outside their canonical locations.

## Where to put new files

| Kind | Location |
|------|----------|
| Nest module / service / controller | `apps/backend/src/<domain>/` |
| Frontend component / page | `apps/frontend/` (layout TODO) |
| Prisma model / migration | `apps/prisma/` |
| Compose / Dockerfile | `infra/compose`, `infra/docker` |
| Cursor rules | `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` |
| Root README / docs | repo root or `docs/` (TODO) |

## Forbidden without an explicit ask

- New top-level packages outside `apps/` and `infra/`.
- Committing `node_modules`, lockfile noise as duplicates, or build artifacts.
- Creating `.env` with secrets; only `.env.example` without secrets.
- Dropping scratch scripts in the repo root — TODO: scratch dir (e.g. `.temp/`) or keep untracked.
- Hand-editing generated code (Prisma Client, `dist`).

